        "text": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Mmaks = &#8539; x (q x L</span><sup><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2</span></sup><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">) = &#8539; x (40 kg/m x 25 m</span><sup><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">2</span></sup><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">) = 125 kg.m</span></p>"
