    "question": "<p><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">Perhatikan gambar komponen utama </span><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">gas turbine engine</span></em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> berikut. Pernyataan yang benar tentang prinsip kerja </span><em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\">gas turbine engine</span></em><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"> adalah....</span></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400;\"><img src=\"https://pusmendik.kemendikdasmen.go.id/tka/cbt_images/32399_9496c096233614edd2e71dd174bf2925.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"481\" height=\"145\"></span></p> <p style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-weight: 400; font-size: 12px;\"><em>Sumber: Air Flying Handbook/FAA (2021)</em></span></p>",
